~ start
Oat Milk: Hi! I made an appointment for today. My name is Oat Milk.

Player: Great! Welcome to Show Pony Studio.

Oat Milk: I’m so excited for this! I’ve been wanting to work on my style for ages. 

Oat Milk: Two years at the Clip Clop Cafe and some of the regulars are starting to wonder if I have any other clothes besides my classic outfits.

Player: Alright, well let’s try you out in some new styles and see what we can do.

[drilling/hammering/backdrop/studio setup noises]

Player: Ready?
=> END

~ preppy1
Oat Milk: Ooooooh yes! It reminds me of hand-me-downs from my mom haha

Player: Your mom has a good sense of style!

Oat Milk: It’s just New England old money, but you gotta hand it to ‘em, the clothes are NICE.
=> END

~ preppy4
Oat Milk: My parents weren’t always supportive of me just wanting to be a barista.

Player: You know, I had a guy who was in corporate earlier, and I don’t know that he was any happier.

Oat Milk: Of course not! But still, it would be nice to have something to connect with my parents on.

Oat Milk: [cringe] God knows it’s not music—they don’t appreciate the dulcet tones of the heavy metal band Oat Milkshoe. [/cringe]
=> END

