~ post_photo_best
Oat Milk: Oh my gosh! I really love it!

Oat Milk: To be honest, I’ve been having a lot of trouble finding my style. Not just clothes, I mean.

Oat Milk: My parents and I have fought a lot about where I’m going in life.

Oat Milk: But I’m really happy doing what I do! I get to help people every day. I’m sure you feel similarly doing this.

Oat Milk: I know it’s not saving lives or changing the world, but we’re making people just a little happier. And that matters, right? Even if other people don’t see it the way we do.

Oat Milk: And these clothes make me feel more confident facing the day, while still taking a piece of my parents with me.

Oat Milk: Thank you so much, have a great day!
=> END

